    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n577" root="ارض" body-key="A">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آرض</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِيْرَاضٌ</span>: see 5. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا آرَضُ هذَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَكَانَ</span> <i>How abundant is the herbage</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُشْب</span>) <i>of
this place!</i> or, as some say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا آرَضَ هذِهِ الأَرْضَ</span>
<i>How level,</i> or <i>soft, and productive, and good, is
this land!</i> (Lh, AHn.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آرَضَهُ</span>, (S, K, [in the
CK, incorrectly, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اَرَضَهُ</span>,]) inf. n. as above, (S,)
<i>He</i> (God) <i>caused him to be affected with</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُكَام</span>
[or <i>rheum</i>]. (S, K.)

